Firmaradar MCP Server
Copyright 2026 Firmaradar AS

This product includes software developed at Firmaradar AS
(https://firmaradar.no).

The MCP stdio-server (`firmaradar-mcp`) is a thin client over the
public Firmaradar REST API at https://firmaradar.no/api/v1/.
Usage of the API requires a Firmaradar account and an API key —
see https://firmaradar.no/prising for tiers and rate limits.

Dependencies (see python/pyproject.toml + typescript/package.json
for the canonical version pins):
* mcp (Model Context Protocol SDK) — Apache 2.0
* httpx — BSD-3-Clause
* pydantic — MIT
